config ZMK_GATT_LAYER_PROBE
    bool "Enable GATT layer probe (custom UUID test)"
    depends on ZMK_BLE
    default n
    help
      Exposes a fake layer value via a custom 128-bit GATT service.
      For Step-1 validation of custom UUID discovery/read/notify on macOS.
      Uses pure Zephyr BT API (no ZMK internal headers).
